Name: lucide-static
URL: https://registry.npmjs.org/lucide-static/-/lucide-static-1.81.0.tgz
Version: 1.81.0
License: ISC and MIT
License File: LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: no
Update Mechanism: Manual

Description:
Lucide SVG geometry for weather and interface icons in offline Agent renders.
The Lucide license includes the MIT notice for icons derived from Feather.

Local Modifications:
Wrap the upstream icon-nodes.json data in an ES module. Use
tools/krypton/vendor_render_icons.py with the exact npm tarballs. Tarball and
license SHA-256 hashes are in ../icon-source-sha256.json and the runtime file
hash is in ../sha256.json.
